<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>C-02 검토 결과 등록 · 방문 준비물</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&display=swap"><style>body{margin:0}</style></head><body><div id="root">

<div style="width: 100%; min-height: 1700px; background: #F6F8FB; font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', 'Pretendard', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #2B2B2B">
<div data-board="StaffFinal" style="width: 100%; min-height: 1700px;">

<div style="width: 100%; min-height: 1700px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #F6F8FB; color: #2B2B2B; font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', 'Pretendard', system-ui, sans-serif">
<div data-board="StaffTopbar" style="width: 100%; min-height: 64px;">

<header style="width: 100%; min-height: 64px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 16px; padding: 10px 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; color: #2B2B2B; font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', 'Pretendard', system-ui, sans-serif">
<a href="StaffDashboard.dc.html" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: #2B2B2B; text-decoration: none">
<svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="1" width="30" height="30" rx="9" fill="#2E70C3"></rect><path d="M8 22 L12.5 10 L17 22 M9.8 17.5 H15.2" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2.4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M19 13 L24.5 21.5 M24.5 13 L19 21.5" stroke="#F2B27F" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
<strong style="font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.3px">AX뱅크</strong>
</a>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="width: 1px; height: 18px; background: #D1D5DB"></span>
<span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E3A5F">사전접수 업무 시스템</span>
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 2px 9px; border-radius: 6px; background: #FDF0E4; border: 1px solid #F2C48D; color: #A3500F; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"></rect><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"></path></svg>직원 전용</span>
<div style="flex: 1 1 0"></div>
<span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 8px">교육용 시연</span>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DDECFD; color: #1F5AA6; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">김</span>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.3"><strong style="font-size: 14px">김신한 님</strong><span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280">사전검토 담당 · 여의도지점</span></div>
</div>
</header>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch">
<div style="flex: 0 0 240px; display: flex"><div data-board="StaffSidebar" style="width: 240px; height: 100%;">

<nav aria-label="직원 메뉴" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 200px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 20px 14px; background: #1E3A5F; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', 'Pretendard', system-ui, sans-serif">
<span style="padding: 4px 12px 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #BFD3EC">업무</span>
<a href="StaffDashboard.dc.html" aria-current="false" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 8px; background: transparent; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="9" rx="1.5"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="5" rx="1.5"></rect><rect x="14" y="12" width="7" height="9" rx="1.5"></rect><rect x="3" y="16" width="7" height="5" rx="1.5"></rect></svg>대시보드</a>
<a href="StaffList.dc.html" aria-current="page" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 8px; background: #2E70C3; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13"></path><circle cx="4" cy="6" r="1"></circle><circle cx="4" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="4" cy="18" r="1"></circle></svg>사전검토 업무함</a>
<a href="StaffBranch.dc.html" aria-current="false" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 8px; background: transparent; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4"></path></svg>여의도지점 예약 업무함</a>
<div style="flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 24px"></div>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="height: 1px; background: #33557F; margin: 4px 6px"></span>
<a href="StaffLogin.dc.html" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; height: 48px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 8px; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M20 12H9M16 8l4 4-4 4"></path></svg>로그아웃</a>
</nav>
</div></div>

<main style="flex: 999 1 560px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 24px 32px 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">

<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<a href="StaffDetail.dc.html" style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563; text-decoration: none"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6"></path></svg>Case 상세</a>
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.4px">검토 결과 등록</h1>
<span style="font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563"><span style="font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace">C-20261020-002</span> · 상속예금 해지 및 지급 사전접수 · 이서연 · 검토 중 (김신한)</span>
</div>


<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start">
<div style="flex: 3 1 560px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">

<section aria-labelledby="sm" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<h2 id="sm" style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700">서류 확인 요약</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; font-size: 14px"><span style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: #F6F8FB">제출 5건</span><span style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: #E6F4EC; color: #1B6B42; font-weight: 700">확인 완료 5건</span><span style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: #F3F4F6; color: #4B5563">보완 필요 0건</span><span style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: #FFF4E5; color: #9A4A00">직원 확인 항목 4건 확인</span></div>
<span style="font-size: 13px; color: #4B5563">가족관계·기본증명서 원문으로 상속인 3명과 사망 기재를 확인했어요. 이도현님은 잠정 불참 상태로 방문 여부 미확정.</span>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="dr" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #A9C6EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><span style="padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: #1E3A5F; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700">직원 Agent</span><h2 id="dr" style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700">검토 의견 초안</h2><span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280">참고용 · 결과를 정하지 않아요</span></div>
<p style="margin: 0; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px; background: #F6F8FB; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; white-space: pre-line">예금 합계 6,800,000원으로 상속인 전원이 필요하며, 이도현님 방문 여부가 미확정입니다. 서류 원문 확인에 문제가 없다면 ‘진행 가능’으로 하되 불참 기준 위임서류를 함께 안내하는 방안을 고려할 수 있습니다.</p>
<span style="font-size: 12px; color: #1F5AA6">근거: C02-01 – 해지 요청 인원 · 불참 상속인 위임 · 결과서 run #2</span>
<button type="button" style="align-self: flex-start; height: 40px; padding: 0 14px; border: 1px solid #2E70C3; border-radius: 8px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #1F5AA6; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer">초안을 의견란에 넣고 수정하기</button>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="rs" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<h2 id="rs" style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700">검토 결과</h2>
<div role="radiogroup" aria-label="검토 결과" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 10px">

<button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 4px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid #1B6B42; background: #E6F4EC; text-align: left; font-family: inherit; color: #2B2B2B; cursor: pointer"><strong style="font-size: 15px; color: #1B6B42">진행 가능</strong><span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4B5563">방문 예약 안내가 고객에게 열려요</span></button>

<button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 4px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #D1D5DB; background: #FFFFFF; text-align: left; font-family: inherit; color: #2B2B2B; cursor: pointer"><strong style="font-size: 15px; color: #B42318">요건 미충족</strong><span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4B5563">신청 요건 불충족 · 접수 종료</span></button>

<button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 4px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #D1D5DB; background: #FFFFFF; text-align: left; font-family: inherit; color: #2B2B2B; cursor: pointer"><strong style="font-size: 15px; color: #A3500F">서류 부족</strong><span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4B5563">서류로 확인 불가 · 접수 종료 · 재신청은 새 Case</span></button>

</div>




<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: #F6F8FB">
<strong style="font-size: 14px">방문 준비물 확정 (고객 예약 상세에 연결)</strong>
<label style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5"><input type="checkbox" checked="" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; margin: 2px 0px 0px; accent-color: rgb(46, 112, 195);"><span>방문 상속인(정미숙·이서연) 신분증 원본, 도장 또는 서명 <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280">필수</span></span></label><label style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5"><input type="checkbox" checked="" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; margin: 2px 0px 0px; accent-color: rgb(46, 112, 195);"><span>피상속인 상세 가족관계증명서·기본증명서 원본 (3개월 이내) <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280">필수</span></span></label><label style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5"><input type="checkbox" checked="" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; margin: 2px 0px 0px; accent-color: rgb(46, 112, 195);"><span>이도현님 불참 시: 신분증 사본, 인감증명서(본인발급용), 인감 날인 위임장 또는 앱 위임장 접수번호 <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280">불참 시 · 잠정 불참 반영</span></span></label><label style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5"><input type="checkbox" checked="" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; margin: 2px 0px 0px; accent-color: rgb(46, 112, 195);"><span>해지할 통장과 거래도장 <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280">생략 가능</span></span></label>
<span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280">템플릿 안내(Spring) + 직원 확인. 방문 예약은 예금 지급 확정이 아니라는 문구가 자동으로 붙어요.</span>
</div>


<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<label for="op" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700">고객에게 보낼 직원 의견 (확정한 문구만 그대로 발송)</label>
<textarea id="op" rows="4" value="" placeholder="결과 사유와 다음 안내를 적어 주세요" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(201, 211, 224); border-radius: 6px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; resize: vertical;"></textarea>

</div>
</section>
</div>

<aside aria-labelledby="pv" style="flex: 2 1 340px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; position: sticky; top: 20px">
<section style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<h2 id="pv" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700">고객 안내 미리보기</h2>
<div style="padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280">웹 알림</span><strong style="font-size: 14px">상속예금 사전검토 결과: 진행 가능</strong><span style="font-size: 12px; color: #4B5563">C-20261020-002 · 등록 즉시 발송</span></div>
<div style="padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6"><span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280">이메일 · seo***@example.com</span><strong>[AX뱅크] 상속예금 해지 및 지급 사전접수 검토 결과 안내</strong><span>검토 결과: <strong>진행 가능</strong></span><span style="white-space: pre-line; color: #374151">(직원 의견을 입력하면 여기에 그대로 표시돼요)</span><span style="color: #1F5AA6">[방문 영업점 예약하기] 링크 · 직원이 확인한 방문 준비물 포함</span><span style="font-size: 11px; color: #6B7280">본 안내는 모의 접수 검토 결과이며 법정 통지·최종 결정이 아니에요. 교육용 시연 미리보기.</span></div>
</section>
<div style="padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: #EEF6FE; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1E3A5F">‘진행 가능’을 등록하면 고객에게 예약 안내가 열려요. 예약은 자동으로 만들어지지 않고, 고객이 지점·시간을 직접 골라요.</div>
<button type="button" style="height: 52px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: #2E70C3; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer">결과 등록하고 고객에게 안내</button>
<span style="font-size: 12px; color: #6B7280; text-align: center">등록 전에는 고객에게 아무것도 발송되지 않아요.</span>
</aside>
</div>




</main>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div></body></html>